  "title": "Pork Liver Pudding",
  "description": "This liver pudding mixture baked with spices can also be made into cakes or patties and fried in butter in a frying pan. It is a little bit runny so don&#39;t shape patties, just drop it from a spoon like pancakes.",
  "authors": [
